title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: b_fundraising_timer <= 0
on-arrival: b_fundraising_timer = 4; week_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/ruble.jpg
tags: b_party

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ (Math.round((Q.party_membership / 100 * Q.b_dues) * (0.25 + (1-(Q.instability/100)))) +] party funds gained.
on-arrival: b_resources += Math.round((Q.party_membership / 100 * Q.b_dues) * (0.25 + (1-(Q.instability/100))); 

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ (Math.round((Q.party_membership / 100 * (Q.b_dues - 1)) * (0.25 + (1-(Q.instability/100)))) +] party funds gained.
choose-if: b_dues > 1
unavailable-subtitle: We've already abolished dues. 
on-arrival: b_dues -= 1; b_resources += Math.round((party_membership / 100 * b_dues) * (0.25 + (1-(instability/100))); b_dissent -= 0.1; leninist_dissent -= 4; moderate_dissent -= 4; leftcom_dissent -= 4;

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: [+ (Math.round((Q.party_membership / 100 * (Q.b_dues + 1)) * (0.25 + (1-(Q.instability/100)))) +] party funds gained. [? if hunger >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if b_dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: b_dues += 1; b_resources += Math.round((party_membership / 100 * b_dues) * (0.25 + (1-(instability/100))); workers_bolshevik -= 3; underclass_bolshevik -= 3; workers_bolshevik -= 10 if hunger >= 15; underclass_bolshevik -= 10 if hunger >= 15; workers_bolshevik -= 3*b_dues if b_dues >= 5; underclass_bolshevik -= 3*b_dues if b_dues >= 5; leninist_dissent += 4; center_dissent += 4; moderate_dissent += 4; b_dissent += 0.1;

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources.

[? if hunger >= 15: Given the present levels of poverty and hunger, raising dues may be a bad idea. ?]
